      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "title",
      "source_text": "俺たちが、『男極〇〇〇〇』だ！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これより、元・男極主催者が開催する\n大型ライブに向けて、ミーティングを行う。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆、忌憚なく意見を述べてほしい。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日もレッスンは順調でしたけど、\n問題は、当日向こうがどう出るか、ですよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なんせ、自分にとって都合が悪い相手を、\nとことん邪魔立てしてきた男だしな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回も、何があるか分からない。あらゆる妨害を\n受けると想定して、対策を立てておかないとな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……。まずは、俺からいいかな？\n当日の移動について、ひとつ提案があるんだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "数時間後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-20:caption",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（今日のレッスンも無事に終わった。今のうちに、\nトレーニングウェアや衣装をチェックしておこう）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、お疲れさま。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "む、それは……。\nどれも、破れやほつれができているな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それだけ皆さんがレッスンを頑張っている証拠です！\nライブまでには直るので、安心してくださいね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_a:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 43,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…………。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
